OL,3,GNEWSAHot meals 'hopefully' in primary
OL,4,Aschools by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FHot meals will "hopefully" be rolled
OL,7,Fout across primary schools by the next
OL,8,Fgeneral election, a leading politician
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FGuernsey's Education President Paul
OL,12,FMontague said his committee was
OL,13,Fcontinuing work started by the previous
OL,14,FStates government to consider
OL,15,Fintroducing the provision before 2030.
OL,17,FCurrently, none of the island's 12
OL,18,Fmainstream primary schools offer hot
OL,19,Fmeals to pupils.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
