OL,3,GNEWSAHot meals 'hopefully' in primary
OL,4,Aschools by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FMontague said a "range of options" were
OL,7,Fbeing considered by him and the
OL,8,Fcommittee which included offering
OL,9,Fchildren from lower income households
OL,10,Ffree meals.
